                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "сопли́вы"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "093a574d-7057-4616-81df-dac0c0c3ee2f",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "сопли́вее"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0d96d80e-fd29-4d15-82b1-9aa153f9f72e",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "сопли́вей"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30d559b8-6b19-3244-9938-7604a86e9873",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. такой, у которого текут сопли"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d574c3a4-9626-4c11-82ce-46c4ef4b934d",
                                "sense_id": "30d559b8-6b19-3244-9938-7604a86e9873",
                                "text": "Много детей в Козелщине, и как сопливы они, в каких болячках их щеки и губы!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d627659-4fcf-3e44-b3e0-431fd69e92c8",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост., перен. плаксивый, слезливый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e50520a5-ba9e-461a-8509-0fdbdf8cccdd",
                                "sense_id": "4d627659-4fcf-3e44-b3e0-431fd69e92c8",
                                "text": "Через несколько минут уже слышался его сопливый плач в станционном здании ― это писали протокол."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc3ee144-90f4-3714-bdf4-985341933442",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. испачканный соплями"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dc7a03c-5905-43a2-90d4-ce880a4d89d5",
                                "sense_id": "dc3ee144-90f4-3714-bdf4-985341933442",
                                "text": "Сопливый носовой платок."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9d49a95-e6d6-447f-bf30-6751bab02a4c",
                                "sense_id": "dc3ee144-90f4-3714-bdf4-985341933442",
                                "text": "Пьер, однако, схватил её и поднял на руки; она завизжала отчаянно-злобным голосом и своими маленькими ручонками стала отрывать от себя руки Пьера и сопливым ртом кусать их."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c35b5b3e-1c8b-3ce7-b796-0043bb37f145",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. покрытый слизью"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79d76162-df45-40b5-b766-d47b13372877",
                                "sense_id": "c35b5b3e-1c8b-3ce7-b796-0043bb37f145",
                                "text": "― И его чистить нельзя, ерша, как есть, сопливого надо варить."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f89236b5-f3bb-3baf-8c08-673509b221f4",
                        "entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост., уничиж. малолетний или очень молодой и неопытный, неумелый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d795503c-a63a-4631-8b9a-b4d75145fe99",
                                "sense_id": "f89236b5-f3bb-3baf-8c08-673509b221f4",
                                "text": "Пошёл, негодник, пошёл, сопливый, пошёл, пошёл к своим сверстникам!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba7a143d-66df-4e09-9ebc-f47f6a8cf33d",
                                "sense_id": "f89236b5-f3bb-3baf-8c08-673509b221f4",
                                "text": "Ещё маленьким, сопливым шкетом Гришка любил свободу и самостоятельность."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b8bd7f7-3038-4f90-824d-b2ec57f4c04c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a124987c-2616-3c8f-87e7-f5cd193c3f1d",
                        "target_lang_word": "snotty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "snotty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b171f91-8dbe-33e8-b1fe-cebce7446f84",
                                        "entry_id": "05e81b0c-9941-3522-af95-e926f7d0b02d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Running or dirtied with mucus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c1ec927-a672-3c6a-98d2-695ca68b875d",
                                        "entry_id": "05e81b0c-9941-3522-af95-e926f7d0b02d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or characteristic of mucus, especially in texture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f8e29eb-efd2-4fc1-b738-8994cb1ca6c1",
                                                "sense_id": "5c1ec927-a672-3c6a-98d2-695ca68b875d",
                                                "text": "Greasy hamburgers or snotty eggs? How about some of those fine pancakes that needed a steak knife to hack through?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f03e5b9-5456-38b7-b54f-683b67403173",
                                        "entry_id": "05e81b0c-9941-3522-af95-e926f7d0b02d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ill-tempered or impertinent in an arrogant, conceited manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5befca90-dc7a-4fad-8ab3-95d31cc28b27",
                                                "sense_id": "4f03e5b9-5456-38b7-b54f-683b67403173",
                                                "text": "\"None of your business,\" she said. She can be very snotty sometimes. She can be quite snotty. \"I suppose you failed in every single subject again,\" she said—very snotty. It was sort of funny, too, in a way. She sounds like a goddam schoolteacher sometimes, and she's only a little child."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c2e97b7-81b7-4b7f-b31b-4965b05dc21a",
                                                "sense_id": "4f03e5b9-5456-38b7-b54f-683b67403173",
                                                "text": "The people there where mostly white, and mostly poor. There wasn't much of a middle class, except for a few well-educated folk trying hard not to be snotty so their kids wouldn't get beat up at school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd7d27c-051c-469d-bd58-402d2912235e",
                                                "sense_id": "4f03e5b9-5456-38b7-b54f-683b67403173",
                                                "text": "Becky had been trying to move out of the society pages and into stories of more substance in recent months, a major shift for her. When I worked for the Herald, she was kind of a mincy, snotty little thing who dressed in heels and blouses […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snotty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1941343b-5e40-3871-9c45-3e03fe44d058",
                                        "entry_id": "97193daf-7ee7-37d0-bab3-99f202d7883b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lion's mane jellyfish, which secretes a mucus that can foul fishing nets."
                                        ],
